  "d.tg8bac": "The MERIDIAN as shown in the game's hangar menu, version 0.6.1 hull, three-quarter view on black.",
  "d.tg8pdz": "It offers 8 shield colours, plus a custom colour.",
  "d.th2bvi": "Segments, in order: L1, class id, hull digit + shield digit, colour, hardpoint tokens, craft id, craft hull digit + craft shield digit, craft hardpoint tokens. Colour is '-' for STOCK, 'p<k>' for palette entry k, or six lower-case hex digits. A segment is stock when it is '00' (tiers), '-' (colour, craft) or empty (hardpoints); every stock segment after the last non-stock one is dropped, earlier ones are kept. The craft segments exist only for a class with a hangar bay. An option the class cannot take reads as STOCK.",
  "d.tjh47s": "Heat builds with every group shot; the guns overheat at a limit and recover below a lower one.",
  "d.tnqgr2": "Game code ported from the GPL prototype",
  "d.tqhusf": "Fixed guns aim at the class's convergence point; turrets aim at their target's lead point inside their arc.",
  "d.uq3bbi": "RAILGUNS",
  "d.v0hnua": "Made for the dads who never had the time to live out their childhood selves.",
