  "d.vktsja": "DESTROYER",
  "d.vway3": "Hold the rocket trigger for a ripple. Launchers fire in turn and the whole magazine reloads when it runs empty.",
  "d.w9u9l8": "We need to understand all the legal requirements of publishing a 100% AI-generated game.",
  "d.wqqgrq": "Point defence is automatic: PD turrets shoot hostile rockets within 1.5 km, and it is never on the trigger.",
  "d.x2k8or": "A drive with a cockpit bolted on. Two lasers, two wing-root guns and the fastest hull in the sector: strike, boost away, repeat.",
  "d.xd9o89": "MULTIROLE INTERCEPTOR",
