  "economy.todayLead": "The LOADOUT screen's hull and shield tiers and shield colours (0.6.0) show the kind of upgrade and cosmetic the economy is meant to offer.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Because its revenue is meant to pay them. The game starts fully AI-made so it can exist at all; paid designers then replace AI work, credited by name.",
